      "url": "https://x.com/connectwithtola/status/2094176248192737723",
      "text": "Dear TEMU @shoptemu stop using SHARP COURIER in LAGOS, NIGERIA.\n\nMy package was marked \"unable to be delivered\" at 6:44 AM few days back.\n\n6:44 AM!!!\n\nNo call, no text, no email, nothing.\n\nThe worst.\n\nYou can't reach them.\n\nThe rider's contact on my package belongs to an ex-employee, and when I called, his mum picked up and lamented that she receives similar calls a lot.\n\nI am afraid SHARP COURIER may steal my goods or may have stolen them.\n\nI emailed them, no response.\n\nNone of their hotlines are reachable. Their WhatsApp contact is also not registered on WhatsApp.\n\nDear TEMU, stop using SHARP COURIER in LAGOS, NIGERIA.",
      "original_text": "Dear TEMU @shoptemu stop using SHARP COURIER in LAGOS, NIGERIA.\n\nMy package was marked \"unable to be delivered\" at 6:44 AM few days back.\n\n6:44 AM!!!\n\nNo call, no text, no email, nothing.\n\nThe worst.\n\nYou can't reach them.\n\nThe rider's contact on my package belongs to an ex-employee, and when I called, his mum picked up and lamented that she receives similar calls a lot.\n\nI am afraid SHARP COURIER may steal my goods or may have stolen them.\n\nI emailed them, no response.\n\nNone of their hotlines are reachable. Their WhatsApp contact is also not registered on WhatsApp.\n\nDear TEMU, stop using SHARP COURIER in LAGOS, NIGERIA.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "亲爱的 TEMU @shoptemu，请停止在尼日利亚拉各斯使用 SHARP COURIER。\n\n我的包裹几天前在早上 6:44 被标记为“无法送达”。\n\n早上 6:44！！！\n\n没有电话，没有短信，没有邮件，什么都没有。\n\n最糟糕。\n\n你联系不上他们。\n\n我包裹上的骑手联系方式属于一名前员工，我打过去时，是他妈妈接的，她抱怨说她经常接到类似的电话。\n\n我担心 SHARP COURIER 可能会偷我的货，或者已经偷了。\n\n我给他们发了邮件，没有回复。\n\n他们所有的热线都打不通。他们的 WhatsApp 联系方式也没有注册 WhatsApp。\n\n亲爱的 TEMU，请停止在尼日利亚拉各斯使用 SHARP COURIER。",
