    {
      "post_id": "2094207077526958287",
      "url": "https://x.com/bekougc/status/2094207077526958287",
      "text": "Temu's marketing is insane \n\nPDD Holdings spent $17.9B on sales & marketing in 2025 \n\nthat's across the whole company, so Temu's exact ad spend isn't public \n\nbut the results speak for themselves \n\nTemu went from a new shopping app in 2022 to a global marketplace across 80+ markets \n\nthey already pay creators to make content around their products \n\nbut I think they're still leaving money on the table \n\nif I were running their growth, I'd build an AI-powered UGC team\n \n-thousands of products\n-hundreds of content ideas\n-creators make the best ones\n-put more money behind the winners \n-more people see the products\n-more sales \n\nthe CTA is simple: \n\nsee the product → watch the video → click → buy \n\nTemu already has the products and the creators \n\nAI could let them produce far more UGC and test more ideas at the same time \n\nthat's where I'd push next",
      "original_text": "Temu's marketing is insane  \n\nPDD Holdings spent $17.9B on sales & marketing in 2025  \n\nthat's across the whole company, so Temu's exact ad spend isn't public  \n\nbut the results speak for themselves  \n\nTemu went from a new shopping app in 2022 to a global marketplace across 80+ markets  \n\nthey already pay creators to make content around their products  \n\nbut I think they're still leaving money on the table  \n\nif I were running their growth, I'd build an AI-powered UGC team\n    \n-thousands of products\n-hundreds of content ideas\n-creators make the best ones\n-put more money behind the winners   \n-more people see the products\n-more sales  \n\nthe CTA is simple:   \n\nsee the product → watch the video → click → buy  \n\nTemu already has the products and the creators  \n\nAI could let them produce far more UGC and test more ideas at the same time  \n\nthat's where I'd push next",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "Temu 的营销太疯狂了\n\nPDD Holdings 在 2025 年花了 $17.9B 用于销售和营销\n\n这是整个公司的支出，所以 Temu 的确切广告花费并未公开\n\n但结果说明了一切\n\nTemu 从 2022 年的一个新购物 app，发展成覆盖 80+ 个市场的全球 marketplace\n\n他们已经在付费让创作者围绕他们的产品制作内容\n\n但我认为他们仍然错失了赚钱机会\n\n如果是我来负责他们的增长，我会组建一个由 AI 驱动的 UGC 团队\n \n-数千种产品\n-数百个内容创意\n-创作者制作其中最好的内容\n-给胜出的内容投入更多资金\n-更多人看到这些产品\n-更多销售\n\nCTA 很简单：\n\n看到产品 → 观看视频 → 点击 → 购买\n\nTemu 已经拥有产品和创作者\n\nAI 可以让他们同时产出更多 UGC，并测试更多想法\n\n这就是我接下来会推进的方向",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户在 公开社媒上讨论与品牌相关的购物体验。",
